  }}
  .kpi .sub {{ font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }}
  .kpi.primary {{ border-top-color: var(--brand); background: #FFF9ED; }}
  .grid-2 {{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }}
  .chart-box {{
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 22px 14px;
    margin: 14px 0;
  }}
  .chart-box h4 {{ margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--brand); font-weight: 600; }}
  .chart-wrap {{ position: relative; height: 320px; }}
  .chart-wrap.tall {{ height: 380px; }}
  table {{
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }}
  th, td {{ padding: 10px 12px; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }}
  th:first-child, td:first-child {{ text-align: left; }}
  thead th {{
    background: #F5EFE4;
    color: var(--brand);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }}
  tbody tr:hover {{ background: #FBF7EE; }}
  .trend-up {{ color: var(--good); font-weight: 600; }}
  .trend-down {{ color: var(--bad); font-weight: 600; }}
  .callout {{
    background: #FFF6E4;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 14px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }}
  .caveat {{
    background: #F3EFEA;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--muted);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #4A433C;
  }}
  .insight-list {{ margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px; }}
  .insight-list li {{ margin-bottom: 8px; }}
  footer {{ text-align: center; margin-top: 48px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }}
  @media (max-width: 900px) {{
    .kpi-grid {{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }}
    .grid-2 {{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }}
  }}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">Retail Analytics · FY 2023–2024</div>
  <h1>Chocolate Retail Sales Performance Report</h1>
  <p class="sub">A comprehensive two-year review of revenue, profitability, product mix, promotional effectiveness, and customer behavior — prepared for retail management to inform FY planning.</p>
  <div class="meta">
    <div><strong>Period:</strong> {d['date_min']} → {d['date_max']}</div>
    <div><strong>Transactions:</strong> {fmt_int(d['total_orders'])}</div>
    <div><strong>Stores:</strong> {d['total_stores']}</div>
    <div><strong>Products:</strong> {d['unique_products']}</div>
    <div><strong>Customers:</strong> {fmt_int(d['unique_customers'])}</div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- EXECUTIVE SUMMARY -->
<h2 class="section">Executive Summary</h2>
<p class="lede">Over the 2023–2024 period, the business generated <strong>{fmt_money(d['total_revenue'])}</strong> in revenue and <strong>{fmt_money(d['total_profit'])}</strong> in profit on {fmt_int(d['total_orders'])} transactions, holding a healthy <strong>{fmt_pct(d['overall_profit_margin'])}</strong> profit margin. Revenue grew <strong>{d['rev_yoy']:+.1f}%</strong> year-over-year — modest momentum that warrants focus on growth levers in FY planning.</p>

<div class="kpi-grid">
  <div class="kpi primary">
    <div class="lbl">Total Revenue</div>
    <div class="val">{fmt_money(d['total_revenue'])}</div>
    <div class="sub">2023–2024 combined</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi primary">
    <div class="lbl">Total Profit</div>
    <div class="val">{fmt_money(d['total_profit'])}</div>
    <div class="sub">Revenue minus cost</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi primary">
    <div class="lbl">Avg Profit Margin</div>
    <div class="val">{fmt_pct(d['avg_profit_margin'])}</div>
    <div class="sub">Mean transaction margin</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi">
    <div class="lbl">Avg Order Value</div>
    <div class="val">{fmt_money2(d['avg_order_value'])}</div>
    <div class="sub">Per transaction</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi">
    <div class="lbl">Discount Utilization</div>
    <div class="val">{fmt_pct(d['discount_util_rate'])}</div>
    <div class="sub">Orders with a discount</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h3>Headline Findings</h3>
  <ul class="insight-list">
    <li><strong>Flat growth trajectory.</strong> Revenue rose <span class="trend-up">{d['rev_yoy']:+.1f}%</span> YoY and profit <span class="trend-up">{d['profit_yoy']:+.1f}%</span> — the business is stable but not expanding. Breaking out of flat requires either category-level promotion, underperforming-store intervention, or customer reactivation.</li>
    <li><strong>Margins are remarkably consistent.</strong> Across every discount tier, profit margin holds near {fmt_pct(d['overall_profit_margin'])}. This indicates pricing discipline but also suggests current discount depths are not driving incremental margin benefit.</li>
    <li><strong>Customer concentration is moderate.</strong> The top 10% of customers account for {fmt_pct(d['top_10pct_cust_rev_share'])} of revenue, with average customer revenue at {fmt_money2(d['avg_revenue_per_cust'])} across {d['avg_orders_per_cust']:.2f} orders.</li>
    <li><strong>Promotional volume lift is unclear.</strong> Average quantity per transaction is effectively identical (~3.0 units) across discounted and non-discounted orders — indicating discounts currently do not materially drive unit uplift.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="grid-2">
  <div class="chart-box">
    <h4>Revenue by Year</h4>
    <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="yearlyRev"></canvas></div>
  </div>
  <div class="chart-box">
    <h4>Profit by Year</h4>
    <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="yearlyProfit"></canvas></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SALES TRENDS -->
<h2 class="section">Sales Trends Over Time</h2>
<p class="lede">Monthly and quarterly momentum reveals the shape of demand across the two-year window. The charts below make seasonality and year-over-year dynamics immediately visible.</p>

<div class="chart-box">
  <h4>Monthly Revenue — 2023 vs 2024 (YoY comparison)</h4>
  <div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="monthlyYoY"></canvas></div>
</div>

<div class="chart-box">
  <h4>Monthly Revenue & Profit Trend (24-month series)</h4>
  <div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="monthlyTrend"></canvas></div>
</div>

<div class="grid-2">
